# ultrawidelock_anchor tier: the sealed link's AES-CCM envelope
# (CONFIG_ULTRAWIDELOCK_SEALED_LINK). The ONE copy -- it was two, one per app,
# and the ESP32 satellite would have made three. Separate from anchor_msg.list
# because the codec is crypto-free and the envelope is not: a build that only
# encodes a report pulls in no crypto backend. Depends on ultrawidelock_prim.h;
# the selected provider owns PSA (PSA on nRF, mbedTLS-PSA on ESP32).
# Consumers: modules/ultrawidelock_anchor/CMakeLists.txt,
# ports/esp32/components/ultrawidelock_anchor, tests/host/sources.sh.
# Sorted; add HERE and nowhere else.
modules/ultrawidelock_anchor/src/ultrawidelock_seal.c
